[  511.2s] NOTE DECISION Third-party card: No information at all, not even whether the card exists. The agent says it can only act on the caller's own cards for security reasons and sends the call back to the IVR login step, phrased as the login step in the main menu. [sources: kickoff Q8 (Burcu); 2026-10-08 §8.6, §10; example-scenarios Ex.5] CONFLICT: Ex.5 says 'routes to the main menu'; the analysis says the IVR login step. The farewell covers both.
